SPECTATOR ->
Implementation-defined signed integer value for the spectator team.

PID_BROADCAST ->
Implementation-defined signed integer broadcast pid that refers to all connected players.

PID_COLOR_ANONYMOUS ->
Deprecated.

MAX_PLAYERS ->
The most player IDs the implementation and protocol can handle at once. I.e., usually 32.
Valid player IDs are integers in the range of 0 to MAX_PLAYERS&minus;1 inclusive.

ENET_PORT ->
UDP port the server is listening for <a rel=noreferrer href=http://sauerbraten.org/enet/>ENet</a> connections on.
